OL,3,GNEWSA'Peaceful caravan park will be
OL,4,Aruined by 670 Sizewell workers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaravan owners said a "peaceful"
OL,7,Fholiday park would be "destroyed" if
OL,8,Fhundreds of workers constructing a
OL,9,Fnearby nuclear power plant were
OL,10,Faccommodated at the site.
OL,12,FThe Cakes and Ale Holiday Park, near
OL,13,FLeiston, Suffolk, opened in 1968 and is
OL,14,Fa destination for families and
OL,15,Fholidaymakers from across the UK.
OL,17,FIn 2023 the 45-acre site was purchased
OL,18,Fby the Harrison Leisure Group for #8m,
OL,19,Fwhich last year started allowing
OL,20,Fcontractors who were building Sizewell
OL,21,FC to stay at the park.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
