OL,3,GNEWSA'Peaceful caravan park will be
OL,4,Aruined by 670 Sizewell workers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said it now wanted to
OL,7,Freconfigure parts of the site to
OL,8,Faccommodate up to 670 workers and
OL,9,Freverse the financial impact of poor
OL,10,Fcaravan sales.
